{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788064650370215173,"compiled_state":{"alias":"deranged-declinable-xanthareel","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d5336109465f1c052b568cc1289119fe182f7dd2526226f768aad29602dece58","event_uuid":"e0f13374-8640-4928-ab8f-a023140aa1f6","position":{"commit_sha":"9c9c97c947154efd85dad3260b8e5bbe5f9b0960","position":"1788059487228341842-e0f13374-8640-4928-ab8f-a023140aa1f6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"47ef9f791b498c2579106d3acb3225221ffe6422a0691cfd82df02c82efbcf5b","event_uuid":"c619ebb8-f02f-4e1c-a816-b6333dcab036","position":{"commit_sha":"14aa931a9de809618b937a005101c1c9c2b35eec","position":"1788059504379737896-c619ebb8-f02f-4e1c-a816-b6333dcab036"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788059487228341842,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c619ebb8-f02f-4e1c-a816-b6333dcab036","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9097-2741-6462-424c"}],"description":"## Prevention remediation for incident 1c0d (CI/test lane)\n\nPost-mortem: `9097-2741-6462-424c`. This is the **detection guard that would have caught the incident before prod**: a contract/regression test asserting that *any* provider transient failure degrades to a **retryable** disposition, never a hard INDETERMINATE.\n\n### Problem it guards\nA throttled primary (429/`WAIT_AND_RETRY`) that fails over to an uncredentialed fallback surfaced as `NEEDS_INVESTIGATION` → INDETERMINATE. The 1c0d fix (change 2404) added a held-out oracle for the specific keyless-`TypeError` case, but there is no *broad* contract test pinning the class invariant.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A test drives a real `build_fallback_model` chain (mocked providers, **zero live Bedrock**) where the primary raises each retryable transient (throttle 429, timeout, 5xx) and the terminal fallback arm raises a non-retryable error (credential `TypeError`, config error). Asserts the classified disposition is retryable (exit-11), never INDETERMINATE.\n- [ ] A vocabulary/closure assertion: a `FallbackExceptionGroup` is classified by its most-recoverable leg (retryable wins); an all-non-retryable group maps to `CHANGE_PROVIDER_OR_MODEL`, never `NEEDS_INVESTIGATION`.\n- [ ] The test would have failed against the pre-2404 tree (confirm by reverting the two fix seams behind the sandbox).\n- [ ] Runs in the normal `make test` matrix (portable — no CI-provider-specific trigger, no network).\n\n### Notes\nThis is test-only, adds no behavior — ready to implement. Complements epic 3405-c0b7's exhaustive `exception→code` contract test (same discipline, different taxonomy: this pins the `ResolutionClass` disposition, 3405 pins the workflow error-code vocabulary).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["prevention","incident-1c0d","llm","ci","regression-oracle"],"ticket_id":"d209-4968-49be-49b0","ticket_type":"task","title":"Prevention (CI/test): regression oracle — provider transient must degrade to retryable, never INDETERMINATE","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e0f13374-8640-4928-ab8f-a023140aa1f6","c619ebb8-f02f-4e1c-a816-b6333dcab036"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788064650370215173,"uuid":"f48e1ca7-24ad-4dc4-af2c-b9bb4d26aeb9"}